{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are the workplaces we go to work in every morning with great dedication really that innocent? Stealth Employee tells the story of an ordinary employee who stumbles upon the shady dealings behind the scenes of a logistics company and these secrets. Sad\u0131k, an employee at an international company called &quot;Incorporated,&quot; discovers the company's secret activities during an assignment. However, possessing this information will endanger his life. The bosses have taken action to eliminate Sad\u0131k. Now, Sad\u0131k must survive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/b46c995e6a7f7643aaf48c5cd02a2dc5.avif?t=1768832170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Young Game Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Employee isn't just a game; it's the story of a young developer's determination. Developed by 13-year-old Emir Cesur, the game took a full year of intense work. Emir personally oversaw every detail to bring you one of the best indie gaming experiences. Be a part of this story\u2014because Stealth Employee is a game made with passion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/17366dae1d9b2fbcf8b08a183bd2389a.avif?t=1768832170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard and comfortable controls: Accessible gameplay for all players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments: Tense and detailed level designs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic storytelling: The dark side of the corporate world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Independent spirit: An original experience from a single developer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/9a086ce8f422d581bf4852fff546c8b2.avif?t=1768832170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lose Yourself in the Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Employee is designed not just to be played, but to be felt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level designs crafted by a single developer will draw you in with their tense atmosphere and intricate detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll feel the tension at every turn as you progress through dark warehouses, quiet office corridors, and the company's secret laboratories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/34d15cc0063da64e9be3387f9a0d8c76.avif?t=1768832170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics or BOOM BOOM BOOM!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Employee is designed for stealth, yet offers complete freedom to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to sneak in and wait for the moment to emerge from the shadows, or break down doors and attack your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of Sad\u0131k is yours to decide.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4167940/d71a53eff3dfad799ac29623d900d29ad3a49e4f.jpg"},{"name":"First Bullet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4167940/4fc2818434d4b17999af8d1c8452c7fca9a8439a.jpg"},{"name":"First Stealth Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4167940/f8aac4dc9f922008208536fa0fa9fb84335d740c.jpg"},{"name":"First Arena Experience","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4167940/048bc3a85c5760c4c0c335fab30635a5ecc3cb2b.jpg"},{"name":"Duel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4167940/7390285ca574c8969fe3027743a4fc9f0f6691f6.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4167940?t=1768832170","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4167940?t=1768832170","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/a48bcecc7e5d83c8bdefb1193090c33a85d44369/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768832170","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/a48bcecc7e5d83c8bdefb1193090c33a85d44369/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768832170","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are the workplaces we go to work in every morning with great dedication really that innocent? Stealth Employee tells the story of an ordinary employee who stumbles upon the shady dealings behind the scenes of a logistics company and these secrets. Sad\u0131k, an employee at an international company called &quot;Incorporated,&quot; discovers the company's secret activities during an assignment. However, possessing this information will endanger his life. The bosses have taken action to eliminate Sad\u0131k. Now, Sad\u0131k must survive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/b46c995e6a7f7643aaf48c5cd02a2dc5.avif?t=1768832170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Young Game Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Employee isn't just a game; it's the story of a young developer's determination. Developed by 13-year-old Emir Cesur, the game took a full year of intense work. Emir personally oversaw every detail to bring you one of the best indie gaming experiences. Be a part of this story\u2014because Stealth Employee is a game made with passion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/17366dae1d9b2fbcf8b08a183bd2389a.avif?t=1768832170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard and comfortable controls: Accessible gameplay for all players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments: Tense and detailed level designs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic storytelling: The dark side of the corporate world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Independent spirit: An original experience from a single developer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/9a086ce8f422d581bf4852fff546c8b2.avif?t=1768832170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lose Yourself in the Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Employee is designed not just to be played, but to be felt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level designs crafted by a single developer will draw you in with their tense atmosphere and intricate detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll feel the tension at every turn as you progress through dark warehouses, quiet office corridors, and the company's secret laboratories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/34d15cc0063da64e9be3387f9a0d8c76.avif?t=1768832170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics or BOOM BOOM BOOM!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Employee is designed for stealth, yet offers complete freedom to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to sneak in and wait for the moment to emerge from the shadows, or break down doors and attack your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of Sad\u0131k is yours to decide.</p>","developers":["Mr. Lemon Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/6a523c1ce72405a756b9a2bdd623beb2c33d2299/header.jpg?t=1768832170","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4167940/989378539/5472aef70cdc97ab5c472f439e78d43a0e65fcbc/1768831429/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768831905","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4167940/989378539/5472aef70cdc97ab5c472f439e78d43a0e65fcbc/1768831429/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768831905","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4167940/989378539/5472aef70cdc97ab5c472f439e78d43a0e65fcbc/1768831429/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768831905","id":257267997,"name":"Stealth Employee | Arena Update | Mr. Lemon Games","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257267997/d7aa1d627d33bcb658c2f2163e8000771b0839b5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768831905"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4167940/2017436044/9404846b4d143330d1b4c2ee047a926e9ec507d2/1762938586/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762962292","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4167940/2017436044/9404846b4d143330d1b4c2ee047a926e9ec507d2/1762938586/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762962292","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4167940/2017436044/9404846b4d143330d1b4c2ee047a926e9ec507d2/1762938586/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762962292","id":257229959,"name":"Stealth Employee | Gameplay Trailer | (2